{
  "video_id": "kF-rThBjFCk",
  "language": "en",
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Close your eyes for a moment and ask",
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "yourself a simple question.",
      "start": 2.0,
      "duration": 4.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Why do you want to speak English",
      "start": 4.64,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "fluently?",
      "start": 6.28,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Is it for confidence?",
      "start": 8.2,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Is it for opportunities?",
      "start": 10.4,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Is it so you can express your thoughts",
      "start": 12.84,
      "duration": 4.28
    },
    {
      "text": "without fear?",
      "start": 14.92,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever your reason is, hold it close",
      "start": 17.12,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "to your heart.",
      "start": 19.8,
      "duration": 3.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Because this journey is not about",
      "start": 21.64,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "language only.",
      "start": 23.44,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "This journey is about becoming a",
      "start": 25.24,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "stronger version of yourself.",
      "start": 27.04,
      "duration": 6.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Fluency is not magic. It is not talent.",
      "start": 29.88,
      "duration": 6.08
    },
    {
      "text": "It is a process.",
      "start": 33.84,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "And every process becomes easy when you",
      "start": 35.96,
      "duration": 6.52
    },
    {
      "text": "break it into small, simple steps.",
      "start": 38.32,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Today,",
      "start": 42.48,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "I will walk with you step by step,",
      "start": 43.64,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "slowly, gently, like a friend holding",
      "start": 46.16,
      "duration": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "your hand.",
      "start": 49.56,
      "duration": 5.8
    },
    {
      "text": "First, understand this truth. You do not",
      "start": 51.24,
      "duration": 7.0
    },
    {
      "text": "need perfect grammar to speak English.",
      "start": 55.36,
      "duration": 6.84
    },
    {
      "text": "You need courage. You need consistency.",
      "start": 58.24,
      "duration": 7.08
    },
    {
      "text": "You need to start.",
      "start": 62.2,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Most people wait.",
      "start": 65.32,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "They wait to become perfect. They wait",
      "start": 67.24,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "to learn everything. And in that",
      "start": 69.92,
      "duration": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "waiting, they lose years. Do not wait.",
      "start": 72.44,
      "duration": 6.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Start now.",
      "start": 76.24,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Step one is listening.",
      "start": 78.64,
      "duration": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Before a child speaks, a child listens.",
      "start": 81.36,
      "duration": 7.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Again and again, every day. You must do",
      "start": 84.88,
      "duration": 5.64
    },
    {
      "text": "the same. Listen to simple English.",
      "start": 88.56,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Listen to short sentences. Listen to",
      "start": 90.52,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "slow speech.",
      "start": 92.68,
      "duration": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, listen to something like,",
      "start": 94.6,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "\"I am going to the market.\"",
      "start": 97.76,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Listen carefully. Notice the sound.",
      "start": 100.36,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Notice the rhythm.",
      "start": 103.64,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not rush. Just listen. Do this every",
      "start": 105.4,
      "duration": 6.76
    },
    {
      "text": "day, morning, evening, whenever you have",
      "start": 109.24,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "time. Even 10 minutes is enough.",
      "start": 112.16,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Consistency is more powerful than",
      "start": 115.12,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "intensity. 1 hour 1 day and nothing for",
      "start": 117.72,
      "duration": 5.759
    },
    {
      "text": "the next 3 days will not help you.",
      "start": 120.88,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "But 15 minutes every day will change",
      "start": 123.479,
      "duration": 4.281
    },
    {
      "text": "you.",
      "start": 126.4,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Now step two, repeat.",
      "start": 127.76,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "When you listen, do not stay silent.",
      "start": 131.0,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Speak with it. Repeat the sentence.",
      "start": 134.04,
      "duration": 7.08
    },
    {
      "text": "I am going to the market. Again. I am",
      "start": 137.28,
      "duration": 6.72
    },
    {
      "text": "going to the market. Do not worry about",
      "start": 141.12,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "mistakes. Your tongue is learning. Your",
      "start": 144.0,
      "duration": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "brain is adjusting. This is how fluency",
      "start": 147.0,
      "duration": 6.36
    },
    {
      "text": "begins. At first, you will feel strange.",
      "start": 150.24,
      "duration": 6.44
    },
    {
      "text": "You will feel shy. Your voice may shake,",
      "start": 153.36,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": "but remember, growth always feels",
      "start": 156.68,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "uncomfortable. Stay with it.",
      "start": 159.04,
      "duration": 6.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Step three is understanding meaning.",
      "start": 162.12,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not memorize without understanding.",
      "start": 165.52,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "When you hear a sentence, know what it",
      "start": 168.4,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "means. For example, she is cooking food.",
      "start": 170.44,
      "duration": 6.08
    },
    {
      "text": "This means she is making food. Simple.",
      "start": 173.52,
      "duration": 6.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Clear. Connect English with meaning, not",
      "start": 176.52,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "with fear.",
      "start": 179.72,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Now step four, use small sentences. Many",
      "start": 181.4,
      "duration": 6.04
    },
    {
      "text": "people try to speak big, difficult",
      "start": 185.44,
      "duration": 4.799
    },
    {
      "text": "sentences. They fail. Then they feel",
      "start": 187.44,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "embarrassed. Then they stop. Do not do",
      "start": 190.239,
      "duration": 6.641
    },
    {
      "text": "that. Start small. Say, \"I am tired.\"",
      "start": 193.04,
      "duration": 5.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Say, \"I am happy.\"",
      "start": 196.88,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Say, \"I like tea.\" Say, \"I am learning",
      "start": 198.68,
      "duration": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "English.\" Simple sentences build strong",
      "start": 201.68,
      "duration": 6.64
    },
    {
      "text": "foundations like bricks. One brick at a",
      "start": 204.92,
      "duration": 6.2
    },
    {
      "text": "time creates a strong house.",
      "start": 208.32,
      "duration": 5.919
    },
    {
      "text": "Now step five, speak daily.",
      "start": 211.12,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Even if you are alone, stand in front of",
      "start": 214.239,
      "duration": 5.641
    },
    {
      "text": "a mirror. Look at yourself. Speak.",
      "start": 216.64,
      "duration": 6.72
    },
    {
      "text": "My name is Arsal. I live in Pakistan. I",
      "start": 219.88,
      "duration": 7.12
    },
    {
      "text": "am learning English. Speak slowly. Speak",
      "start": 223.36,
      "duration": 6.96
    },
    {
      "text": "clearly. Do not rush. You may laugh at",
      "start": 227.0,
      "duration": 6.96
    },
    {
      "text": "yourself. That is okay. but do not stop.",
      "start": 230.32,
      "duration": 5.64
    },
    {
      "text": "This is your practice ground. This is",
      "start": 233.96,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "your safe place.",
      "start": 235.96,
      "duration": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Step six is thinking in English. This is",
      "start": 238.4,
      "duration": 6.44
    },
    {
      "text": "powerful. This is where real change",
      "start": 242.2,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": "begins.",
      "start": 244.84,
      "duration": 3.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Right now you think in your native",
      "start": 246.08,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "language and then translate. That takes",
      "start": 247.88,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "time. That creates confusion. Start",
      "start": 250.68,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "small.",
      "start": 253.6,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Look at a glass and think, this is a",
      "start": 254.88,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "glass.",
      "start": 257.44,
      "duration": 3.919
    },
    {
      "text": "Look at your phone and think, this is my",
      "start": 258.72,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "phone.",
      "start": 261.359,
      "duration": 4.041
    },
    {
      "text": "Walk outside and think, the weather is",
      "start": 262.72,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "hot.",
      "start": 265.4,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "These small thoughts will slowly train",
      "start": 266.84,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "your brain.",
      "start": 269.32,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Step seven is vocabulary.",
      "start": 271.48,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "But not difficult vocabulary, useful",
      "start": 274.0,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "vocabulary. Words you use every day. For",
      "start": 276.48,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "example,",
      "start": 279.72,
      "duration": 6.6
    },
    {
      "text": "eat, drink, go, come, make, take, give.",
      "start": 281.04,
      "duration": 8.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Use them in sentences. I eat food. I",
      "start": 286.32,
      "duration": 7.04
    },
    {
      "text": "drink water. I go to school. I come",
      "start": 290.0,
      "duration": 6.76
    },
    {
      "text": "home. Repeat these again and again.",
      "start": 293.36,
      "duration": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Words become yours when you use them,",
      "start": 296.76,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "not when you read them.",
      "start": 299.2,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Step eight is learning phrases.",
      "start": 301.96,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Phrases make your speech natural.",
      "start": 304.48,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Instead of saying, I am very, very",
      "start": 307.28,
      "duration": 7.84
    },
    {
      "text": "tired, you can say, I am really tired.",
      "start": 310.4,
      "duration": 6.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Instead of saying, I do not understand,",
      "start": 315.12,
      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "you can say,",
      "start": 317.28,
      "duration": 2.96
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't get it.",
      "start": 318.52,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "These small changes make a big",
      "start": 320.24,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": "difference.",
      "start": 322.24,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Step nine is listening to real",
      "start": 324.12,
      "duration": 4.799
    },
    {
      "text": "conversations, not just lessons.",
      "start": 325.84,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Watch simple videos. Watch people",
      "start": 328.919,
      "duration": 5.841
    },
    {
      "text": "talking. Notice how they speak. Notice",
      "start": 331.4,
      "duration": 6.12
    },
    {
      "text": "how they pause. Notice how they smile",
      "start": 334.76,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "while speaking. Language is not only",
      "start": 337.52,
      "duration": 6.64
    },
    {
      "text": "words. It is feeling. It is expression.",
      "start": 339.68,
      "duration": 7.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Step 10 is not being afraid of mistakes.",
      "start": 344.16,
      "duration": 6.84
    },
    {
      "text": "This is the most important step. Fear",
      "start": 347.6,
      "duration": 8.16
    },
    {
      "text": "kills fluency. Mistakes build fluency.",
      "start": 351.0,
      "duration": 7.08
    },
    {
      "text": "When you make a mistake, do not stop.",
      "start": 355.76,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Correct it and move forward. For",
      "start": 358.08,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "example, you say, \"He go to school.\"",
      "start": 360.24,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Then you realize, \"He goes to school.\"",
      "start": 363.4,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Good. You learned something. That",
      "start": 366.52,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "mistake made you better.",
      "start": 368.88,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not let people's laughter stop you.",
      "start": 371.0,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "People laugh when they do not understand",
      "start": 373.88,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": "your courage. You are trying. You are",
      "start": 376.12,
      "duration": 6.64
    },
    {
      "text": "growing. That matters.",
      "start": 379.56,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, let me tell you something from the",
      "start": 382.76,
      "duration": 2.6
    },
    {
      "text": "heart.",
      "start": 384.2,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Fluency is not about speaking fast.",
      "start": 385.36,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Fluency is about speaking clearly and",
      "start": 388.76,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "confidently.",
      "start": 391.64,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "You can speak slowly and still be",
      "start": 393.12,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "fluent.",
      "start": 395.2,
      "duration": 2.76
    },
    {
      "text": "I",
      "start": 396.8,
      "duration": 6.2
    },
    {
      "text": "am learning English. This is okay. This",
      "start": 397.96,
      "duration": 8.08
    },
    {
      "text": "is powerful. Speed will come with time.",
      "start": 403.0,
      "duration": 7.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not chase speed. Chase clarity.",
      "start": 406.04,
      "duration": 6.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, step 11.",
      "start": 410.48,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Build daily habits. Make a small",
      "start": 412.16,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "routine.",
      "start": 415.12,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Morning, listen for 10 minutes.",
      "start": 416.48,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Afternoon, practice speaking for 10",
      "start": 419.08,
      "duration": 4.839
    },
    {
      "text": "minutes. Evening, think in English for",
      "start": 421.32,
      "duration": 4.28
    },
    {
      "text": "10 minutes.",
      "start": 423.919,
      "duration": 4.201
    },
    {
      "text": "This simple routine, if done every day,",
      "start": 425.6,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "will transform you.",
      "start": 428.12,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Step 12 is writing. Yes, writing helps",
      "start": 430.36,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "speaking.",
      "start": 433.56,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Write small sentences. I woke up early.",
      "start": 435.04,
      "duration": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "I ate breakfast. I went to work.",
      "start": 437.96,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Writing organizes your thoughts. It",
      "start": 440.88,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "makes speaking easier.",
      "start": 442.96,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Step 13 is conversation.",
      "start": 445.72,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "If you have a friend, practice together.",
      "start": 448.32,
      "duration": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Speak simple English. You, \"How are",
      "start": 451.16,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "you?\" Friend, \"I am fine.\" You, \"What",
      "start": 453.72,
      "duration": 5.8
    },
    {
      "text": "are you doing?\" Friend, \"I am studying.\"",
      "start": 456.52,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Even simple conversations build",
      "start": 459.52,
      "duration": 3.399
    },
    {
      "text": "confidence.",
      "start": 461.36,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "If you do not have a partner, talk to",
      "start": 462.919,
      "duration": 3.601
    },
    {
      "text": "yourself.",
      "start": 465.16,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "It works. It really works.",
      "start": 466.52,
      "duration": 6.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Step 14 is patience.",
      "start": 470.12,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not expect miracles in 1 week.",
      "start": 472.64,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Fluency takes time, but every day you",
      "start": 475.64,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "are improving.",
      "start": 478.36,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Think of it like planting the seed. You",
      "start": 480.08,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "water it daily.",
      "start": 482.6,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": "You do not dig it every day to check if",
      "start": 484.16,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": "it is growing. You trust the process.",
      "start": 485.96,
      "duration": 6.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Step 15 is believing in yourself.",
      "start": 489.84,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Many people quit because they think they",
      "start": 492.88,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "cannot do it. That is not true.",
      "start": 494.6,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "You learned your first language. You can",
      "start": 497.52,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "learn this, too.",
      "start": 499.64,
      "duration": 6.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Say to yourself, I can speak English.",
      "start": 501.88,
      "duration": 7.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Say it again. I can speak English.",
      "start": 505.8,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Because what you say to yourself becomes",
      "start": 509.12,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "your reality.",
      "start": 511.32,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, imagine this.",
      "start": 513.52,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "One day you are standing in a room.",
      "start": 515.64,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "People are speaking English.",
      "start": 518.32,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "And you are not silent anymore.",
      "start": 520.36,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "You are not afraid anymore. You are part",
      "start": 522.68,
      "duration": 6.24
    },
    {
      "text": "of the conversation. You are smiling.",
      "start": 525.64,
      "duration": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "You are confident.",
      "start": 528.92,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "That day will come.",
      "start": 530.72,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "But it will not come by waiting.",
      "start": 533.16,
      "duration": 7.28
    },
    {
      "text": "It will come by working, step by step.",
      "start": 535.88,
      "duration": 7.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not compare yourself with others.",
      "start": 540.44,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Some people learn faster. Some learn",
      "start": 543.0,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "slower. That is okay.",
      "start": 544.92,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Your journey is your own.",
      "start": 547.76,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Focus on your progress.",
      "start": 550.24,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Yesterday, you knew 10 words.",
      "start": 552.6,
      "duration": 6.239
    },
    {
      "text": "Today, you know 20. That is growth.",
      "start": 555.12,
      "duration": 6.12
    },
    {
      "text": "And remember, consistency beats",
      "start": 558.839,
      "duration": 4.081
    },
    {
      "text": "motivation.",
      "start": 561.24,
      "duration": 3.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Some days you will not feel like",
      "start": 562.92,
      "duration": 2.919
    },
    {
      "text": "practicing.",
      "start": 564.52,
      "duration": 2.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Do it anyway.",
      "start": 565.839,
      "duration": 3.121
    },
    {
      "text": "Discipline will take you where",
      "start": 567.44,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "motivation cannot.",
      "start": 568.96,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Speak every day. Even if it is broken",
      "start": 571.04,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "English. Broken English is better than",
      "start": 574.12,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "silent English.",
      "start": 576.64,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "I go market yesterday.",
      "start": 578.64,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "That is okay. You are speaking. Slowly",
      "start": 581.12,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "it will become I went to the market",
      "start": 583.84,
      "duration": 3.32
    },
    {
      "text": "yesterday.",
      "start": 585.72,
      "duration": 3.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Growth is happening.",
      "start": 587.16,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me give you a simple example of",
      "start": 589.36,
      "duration": 2.96
    },
    {
      "text": "progress.",
      "start": 590.92,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Day one, I go school.",
      "start": 592.32,
      "duration": 6.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Day 10, I go to school.",
      "start": 595.48,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Day 30,",
      "start": 598.68,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "I go to school every day.",
      "start": 600.04,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Day 60, I go to school every day because",
      "start": 602.6,
      "duration": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "I want to learn.",
      "start": 605.8,
      "duration": 3.76
    },
    {
      "text": "See the difference?",
      "start": 607.68,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Step by step, no pressure, just",
      "start": 609.56,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "progress.",
      "start": 612.4,
      "duration": 3.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not run,",
      "start": 613.72,
      "duration": 6.12
    },
    {
      "text": "walk, but do not stop.",
      "start": 615.72,
      "duration": 6.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Your voice matters.",
      "start": 619.84,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Your thoughts matter.",
      "start": 622.04,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "English is just a tool to express them.",
      "start": 624.52,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "So, start today, not tomorrow, not next",
      "start": 627.48,
      "duration": 7.52
    },
    {
      "text": "week, today. Speak one sentence, then",
      "start": 630.8,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "another,",
      "start": 635.0,
      "duration": 2.76
    },
    {
      "text": "then another.",
      "start": 636.08,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "And one day, without realizing, you will",
      "start": 637.76,
      "duration": 6.92
    },
    {
      "text": "be fluent, not perfect, but confident.",
      "start": 640.8,
      "duration": 5.88
    },
    {
      "text": "And confidence is more powerful than",
      "start": 644.68,
      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "perfection.",
      "start": 646.68,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep going, keep speaking, keep",
      "start": 648.08,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "believing. Your journey has already",
      "start": 650.72,
      "duration": 3.48
    },
    {
      "text": "begun.",
      "start": 653.04,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "And when your journey begins, something",
      "start": 654.2,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "very quiet, but very powerful, starts",
      "start": 656.64,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "changing inside you.",
      "start": 659.0,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "At first, you don't notice it.",
      "start": 660.96,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "It is not loud. It is not dramatic. It",
      "start": 663.04,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "is small. It is subtle, but it is real.",
      "start": 665.12,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "One day,",
      "start": 668.4,
      "duration": 3.16
    },
    {
      "text": "you will say a sentence without",
      "start": 669.72,
      "duration": 3.04
    },
    {
      "text": "thinking.",
      "start": 671.56,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Just naturally, I understand.",
      "start": 672.76,
      "duration": 5.079
    },
    {
      "text": "And you will pause for a moment and",
      "start": 676.28,
      "duration": 3.28
    },
    {
      "text": "realize",
      "start": 677.839,
      "duration": 3.881
    },
    {
      "text": "you did not translate.",
      "start": 679.56,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "You did not struggle.",
      "start": 681.72,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "It just came out.",
      "start": 683.64,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "That is your first victory.",
      "start": 685.56,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not ignore these small victories.",
      "start": 688.56,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Celebrate them.",
      "start": 690.56,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Because fluency not built in one big",
      "start": 692.28,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "moment. It is built in hundreds of small",
      "start": 695.16,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "moments like this.",
      "start": 698.04,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, let's move forward together.",
      "start": 700.2,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": "You must learn to connect sentences.",
      "start": 702.64,
      "duration": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaking fluently is not about speaking",
      "start": 705.68,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "one sentence. It is about linking your",
      "start": 708.04,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "thoughts.",
      "start": 710.48,
      "duration": 5.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Start with simple connectors: and, but,",
      "start": 711.76,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": "because.",
      "start": 715.72,
      "duration": 3.2
    },
    {
      "text": "For example,",
      "start": 717.24,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "I am tired, but I will work.",
      "start": 718.92,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I am learning English because I want a",
      "start": 722.08,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "better future.",
      "start": 723.92,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "I like tea, and I like coffee.",
      "start": 725.88,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "These small connectors make your speech",
      "start": 728.96,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "longer, smoother, more natural. Practice",
      "start": 731.24,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "them daily.",
      "start": 734.88,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, let's go deeper.",
      "start": 736.6,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Start describing your day in English.",
      "start": 738.72,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Keep it simple.",
      "start": 741.24,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": "I woke up at 7:00.",
      "start": 742.84,
      "duration": 3.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I brushed my teeth.",
      "start": 744.76,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "I ate breakfast. I went outside.",
      "start": 746.48,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": "I talked to my friend.",
      "start": 749.92,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Do this every day, even if your",
      "start": 752.16,
      "duration": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "sentences are small, even if they are",
      "start": 754.56,
      "duration": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "not perfect. This habit will slowly",
      "start": 757.24,
      "duration": 5.24
    },
    {
      "text": "build your confidence. And then comes a",
      "start": 759.96,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "powerful step.",
      "start": 762.48,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Ask yourself questions in English.",
      "start": 764.12,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "What am I doing?",
      "start": 767.08,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Why am I learning English?",
      "start": 768.72,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "What do I want in life?",
      "start": 771.0,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "And then answer those questions.",
      "start": 773.28,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "I am learning English to grow.",
      "start": 775.52,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "I want to become confident. I want to",
      "start": 778.2,
      "duration": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "speak without fear.",
      "start": 780.8,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "When you start asking and answering,",
      "start": 783.28,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "your mind becomes active in English.",
      "start": 785.44,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "This is how fluency grows from inside.",
      "start": 788.0,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, listen carefully.",
      "start": 791.44,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "There will be days when you feel stuck.",
      "start": 793.36,
      "duration": 4.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Days when you feel like you are not",
      "start": 796.0,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "improving. Days when words do not come",
      "start": 797.64,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "out.",
      "start": 800.68,
      "duration": 2.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not panic.",
      "start": 801.76,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "This is part of the process.",
      "start": 803.4,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Learning is not a straight",
      "start": 805.6,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes you move fast, sometimes you",
      "start": 808.08,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "feel slow,",
      "start": 810.72,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "but every step counts.",
      "start": 812.12,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "On those days, go back to basics. Listen",
      "start": 814.28,
      "duration": 7.52
    },
    {
      "text": "more. Speak small sentences. Do not quit",
      "start": 817.28,
      "duration": 6.52
    },
    {
      "text": "because quitting is the only real",
      "start": 821.8,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "failure.",
      "start": 823.8,
      "duration": 3.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, let me tell you something very",
      "start": 825.52,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "honest. Many people understand English,",
      "start": 827.0,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "but they cannot speak.",
      "start": 829.24,
      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Why?",
      "start": 831.32,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Because they are afraid of judgement.",
      "start": 832.64,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "They think, \"What if I say something",
      "start": 835.12,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "wrong?\" They think, \"What if people",
      "start": 837.08,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "laugh?\"",
      "start": 839.68,
      "duration": 3.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me ask you something. If a child",
      "start": 841.0,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "makes a mistake while learning, do you",
      "start": 842.84,
      "duration": 4.8
    },
    {
      "text": "laugh at that child? No.",
      "start": 844.72,
      "duration": 6.52
    },
    {
      "text": "You smile. You encourage. So, why are",
      "start": 847.64,
      "duration": 5.8
    },
    {
      "text": "you so hard on yourself?",
      "start": 851.24,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "You are learning. You are allowed to",
      "start": 853.44,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "make mistakes. Change your mindset.",
      "start": 855.64,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Instead of saying, \"I am afraid to",
      "start": 859.2,
      "duration": 5.48
    },
    {
      "text": "speak.\" say, \"I am learning to speak.\"",
      "start": 861.16,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "That small change will change",
      "start": 864.68,
      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "everything.",
      "start": 866.36,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, let's take another step.",
      "start": 868.08,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Start telling short stories, very simple",
      "start": 870.08,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "stories.",
      "start": 872.48,
      "duration": 4.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Yesterday, I went to the market. I saw",
      "start": 874.0,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "many people. I bought some fruit, then I",
      "start": 876.56,
      "duration": 5.96
    },
    {
      "text": "came home. That's it. Simple, but",
      "start": 879.6,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "powerful.",
      "start": 882.52,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Storytelling improves your fluency",
      "start": 884.0,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "because it connects ideas. It teaches",
      "start": 886.08,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "you flow.",
      "start": 888.68,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "And then, slowly you can make your",
      "start": 890.0,
      "duration": 4.28
    },
    {
      "text": "stories longer.",
      "start": 892.36,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Yesterday, I went to the market because",
      "start": 894.28,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "I needed fruit.",
      "start": 896.32,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "I saw many people and the place was very",
      "start": 897.88,
      "duration": 5.24
    },
    {
      "text": "crowded. I bought apples and bananas,",
      "start": 900.64,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "then I came home and felt happy.",
      "start": 903.12,
      "duration": 5.719
    },
    {
      "text": "See the difference? Step by step. Now,",
      "start": 905.6,
      "duration": 5.96
    },
    {
      "text": "let's talk about pronunciation.",
      "start": 908.839,
      "duration": 4.921
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not try to sound like someone else.",
      "start": 911.56,
      "duration": 5.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Do not try to copy an accent perfectly.",
      "start": 913.76,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Focus on being clear.",
      "start": 917.0,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Say words slowly.",
      "start": 919.32,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Open your mouth. Let the sound come out.",
      "start": 921.64,
      "duration": 5.8
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, not gonna in the beginning,",
      "start": 924.64,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "say going to,",
      "start": 927.44,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "not wanna, say want to.",
      "start": 929.52,
      "duration": 7.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Clarity first, style later.",
      "start": 933.44,
      "duration": 5.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let me give you a small daily",
      "start": 937.16,
      "duration": 2.8
    },
    {
      "text": "practice.",
      "start": 938.52,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Pick one topic, for example food.",
      "start": 939.96,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Speak for 1 minute.",
      "start": 942.88,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "I like food.",
      "start": 945.28,
      "duration": 3.32
    },
    {
      "text": "I like rice.",
      "start": 947.0,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "I eat rice everyday.",
      "start": 948.6,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "My favorite food is biryani.",
      "start": 950.56,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I eat it with my family.",
      "start": 952.8,
      "duration": 6.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Next day pick another topic, family.",
      "start": 955.2,
      "duration": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "My family is important to me.",
      "start": 958.88,
      "duration": 4.76
    },
    {
      "text": "I love my parents. I spend time with",
      "start": 961.04,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "them.",
      "start": 963.64,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "This 1-minute practice is very powerful.",
      "start": 965.44,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "It builds fluency slowly.",
      "start": 968.16,
      "duration": 5.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let's talk about listening again,",
      "start": 971.16,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "but this time listen actively. Do not",
      "start": 973.52,
      "duration": 4.92
    },
    {
      "text": "just hear,",
      "start": 976.88,
      "duration": 5.12
    },
    {
      "text": "focus. Listen to a sentence and pause.",
      "start": 978.44,
      "duration": 7.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Repeat it. Try to copy the tone.",
      "start": 982.0,
      "duration": 5.32
    },
    {
      "text": "For example,",
      "start": 985.6,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "I will not give up. Say it again, I will",
      "start": 987.32,
      "duration": 7.44
    },
    {
      "text": "not give up. Feel the emotion. Language",
      "start": 990.44,
      "duration": 8.36
    },
    {
      "text": "is not only words, it is feeling.",
      "start": 994.76,
      "duration": 6.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Now here is another important truth.",
      "start": 998.8,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "You do not need too many resources, you",
      "start": 1001.56,
      "duration": 5.2
    },
    {
      "text": "need discipline.",
      "start": 1004.4,
      "duration": 6.4
    },
    {
      "text": "One video, one lesson, one practice,",
      "start": 1006.76,
      "duration": 7.079
    },
    {
      "text": "that is enough if you do it daily.",
      "start": 1010.8,
      "duration": 5.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Many people collect content. They watch",
      "start": 1013.839,
      "duration": 6.121
    },
    {
      "text": "many videos, but they do not practice.",
      "start": 1016.4,
      "duration": 6.52
    },
    {
      "text": "That is why they do not improve. Do not",
      "start": 1019.96,
      "duration": 6.04
    },
    {
      "text": "collect, apply.",
      "start": 1022.92,
      "duration": 5.519
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let's move to confidence.",
      "start": 1026.0,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Confidence does not come before",
      "start": 1028.439,
      "duration": 4.841
    },
    {
      "text": "speaking. Confidence comes after",
      "start": 1030.4,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "speaking.",
      "start": 1033.28,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "You speak first, you feel confident",
      "start": 1034.56,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "later.",
      "start": 1037.0,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "So, do not wait to feel ready. Start",
      "start": 1038.16,
      "duration": 5.64
    },
    {
      "text": "even when you feel nervous.",
      "start": 1041.48,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Your voice may shake. That is okay. Say",
      "start": 1043.8,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "the sentence anyway.",
      "start": 1046.64,
      "duration": 3.48
    },
    {
      "text": "I am learning.",
      "start": 1048.52,
      "duration": 3.24
    },
    {
      "text": "I am trying.",
      "start": 1050.12,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "I will improve.",
      "start": 1051.76,
      "duration": 4.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, imagine yourself 6 months from",
      "start": 1054.28,
      "duration": 3.64
    },
    {
      "text": "today.",
      "start": 1056.48,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "If you practice daily, if you follow",
      "start": 1057.92,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "these steps, you will not be the same",
      "start": 1060.4,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "person.",
      "start": 1063.08,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "You will understand more. You will speak",
      "start": 1064.4,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "more. You will feel more confident. But,",
      "start": 1066.88,
      "duration": 6.72
    },
    {
      "text": "if you do nothing, if you keep waiting,",
      "start": 1070.32,
      "duration": 5.52
    },
    {
      "text": "nothing will change. Time will pass",
      "start": 1073.6,
      "duration": 4.84
    },
    {
      "text": "anyway. The question is, will you grow",
      "start": 1075.84,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "with time?",
      "start": 1078.44,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, let me remind you again. Fluency is",
      "start": 1080.08,
      "duration": 4.4
    },
    {
      "text": "not perfection.",
      "start": 1082.28,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Even people who speak English every day",
      "start": 1084.48,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": "make mistakes,",
      "start": 1086.48,
      "duration": 4.6
    },
    {
      "text": "but they keep speaking. That is the",
      "start": 1088.0,
      "duration": 5.8
    },
    {
      "text": "difference. So, speak",
      "start": 1091.08,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "even if it is not perfect. Speak when",
      "start": 1093.8,
      "duration": 4.28
    },
    {
      "text": "you are alone. Speak when you are with",
      "start": 1096.24,
      "duration": 5.04
    },
    {
      "text": "friends. Speak when you are scared.",
      "start": 1098.08,
      "duration": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Because every time you speak, you are",
      "start": 1101.28,
      "duration": 4.96
    },
    {
      "text": "breaking your fear. And every time you",
      "start": 1103.48,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "break your fear, you are building your",
      "start": 1106.24,
      "duration": 3.88
    },
    {
      "text": "future.",
      "start": 1108.36,
      "duration": 3.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, take a deep breath and say this",
      "start": 1110.12,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "with me. I am not afraid.",
      "start": 1111.88,
      "duration": 7.0
    },
    {
      "text": "I am learning every day.",
      "start": 1115.68,
      "duration": 6.6
    },
    {
      "text": "I will speak English fluently. Again,",
      "start": 1118.88,
      "duration": 6.12
    },
    {
      "text": "I am not afraid.",
      "start": 1122.28,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "I am learning every day.",
      "start": 1125.0,
      "duration": 6.28
    },
    {
      "text": "I will speak English fluently.",
      "start": 1128.0,
      "duration": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Hold these words inside you.",
      "start": 1131.28,
      "duration": 4.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Because your belief will guide your",
      "start": 1133.76,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "actions, and your actions will create",
      "start": 1135.56,
      "duration": 5.72
    },
    {
      "text": "your results. So, keep going step by",
      "start": 1138.32,
      "duration": 6.0
    },
    {
      "text": "step, word by word, sentence by",
      "start": 1141.28,
      "duration": 5.68
    },
    {
      "text": "sentence, and one day you will not",
      "start": 1144.32,
      "duration": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "remember when it became easy. You will",
      "start": 1146.96,
      "duration": 4.44
    },
    {
      "text": "just speak",
      "start": 1149.72,
      "duration": 5.4
    },
    {
      "text": "naturally, confidently, fluently. And",
      "start": 1151.4,
      "duration": 5.56
    },
    {
      "text": "when that day comes,",
      "start": 1155.12,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "you will smile and realize",
      "start": 1156.96,
      "duration": 5.28
    },
    {
      "text": "you did not just learn a language,",
      "start": 1159.36,
      "duration": 6.56
    },
    {
      "text": "you transformed yourself.",
      "start": 1162.24,
      "duration": 3.68
    }
  ]
}